 | `aborted`                            | `error_cancelled`        | 130  | Cancelled; the partial work is kept                                                                         |
 | `stalled`, `loop_detected`, `barren` | `error_during_execution` | 1    | Nothing was progressing; resume with a different approach                                                   |
